<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila Central Bank says sees no capital flight.</title>
<headline>Manila Central Bank says sees no capital flight.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Wednesday there was no capital flight following the tumble in the local equities market.</p>
</text>
